  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg007.5.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg007.5.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ἐς τὸ πρὸ τείχευς ἱρὸν ἁλέες δεῦτε, οὗ τὸν πάλαι Παγχαῖον ὁ πλάσας Ζᾶνα γέρων ἀλάζων ἄδικα βιβλία ψήχει.¹",
    "chunk_index": 17,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg007.5.1.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg007.5.1.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Plutarch. De plac. philos. i. 7 (Moral. 880 E) τὸν δ’ Εὐήμερον καὶ Καλλίμαχος ὁ Κυρηναῖος αἰνίττεται ἐν τοῖς Ἰάμβοις γράφων· εἰς τὸ πρὸ κτλ. Cf. schol. Tzetz. Allegor. Cramer, Anecd. Ox. iii. p. 380, E.M. s.v. ἀλές, etc.",
    "chunk_index": 18,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg007.6.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg007.6.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "τὴν ὡγαμέμνων, ὡς ὁ μῦθος, εἵσατο, τῇ καὶ λίπουρα καὶ μονωπὰ θύεται.",
    "chunk_index": 19,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg007.6.1.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg007.6.1.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Schol. Aristoph. Av. 873 Εὐφρόνιος δέ φησιν ὅτι ἐν Ἀμαρύνθῳ ἡ Κολαινὶς διὰ τὸ τὸν Ἀγαμέμνονα θῦσαι αὐτῇ ἐκ τοῦ κηροῦ κριὸν κόλον· ἐπὶ ταύτης δὲ Καλλίμαχος λέγει· τὴν κτλ.",
    "chunk_index": 20,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg007.7.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg007.7.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "οὐ γὰρ ἐργάτιν τρέφω τὴν Μοῦσαν, ὡς ὁ Κεῖος Ὑλλίχου νέπους.",
    "chunk_index": 21,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg007.7.1.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg007.7.1.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Schol. Pind. Isth. ii. 9, cf. Tzetz. Chil. viii. 228.",
    "chunk_index": 22,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg007.8.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg007.8.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ἦν κεῖνος οὑνιαυτός, ᾧ τό τε πτηνὸν καὶ τοὐν θαλάσσῃ καὶ τὸ τετράπουν οὕτως ἐφθέγγεθ’ ὡς ὁ πηλὸς ὁ Προμήθειος.",
    "chunk_index": 23,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg007.8.1.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg007.8.1.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Clem. Alex. Strom. v. p. 707 Pott. γήινον μὲν οἱ φιλόσοφοι . . τὸ σῶμα ἀναγορεύουσι . . . Καλλίμαχος δὲ διαρρήδην γράφει· ἦν κτλ.",
    "chunk_index": 24,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg007.9.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg007.9.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ἐγὼ φαύλη δένδρων ἁπάντων εἰμί.",
    "chunk_index": 25,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg007.9.1.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg007.9.1.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Pseudo-Tryphon, Περὶ τρόπων (Walz, Rhet. Gr. viii. p. 760) παρὰ δὲ Καλλιμάχῳ ἀστειζομένη ἡ ἐλαία φησίν· ἐγὼ φαύλη πάντων τῶν δένδρων εἰμί.",
    "chunk_index": 26,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg007.10.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg007.10.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "καὶ τῶν νεήκων εὐθὺς οἱ τομώτατοι.",
    "chunk_index": 27,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg007.10.1.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg007.10.1.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "E.M. s.v. κόχλος . . . . ὡς παρὰ τὸ ἱερός γίνεται ἱέραξ καὶ νέος νέαξ, ὡς παρὰ Καλλιμάχῳ· καὶ τῶν κτλ.",
    "chunk_index": 28,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg007.11.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg007.11.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "κοὐχ ὧδ’ Ἀρείων τὠπέσαντι πὰρ Διῒ ἔθυσεν Ἀρκὰς ἵππος.",
    "chunk_index": 29,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg007.11.1.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg007.11.1.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Steph. Byz. s.v. Ἀπέσας . . ἀφ’ οὗ Ζεὺς Ἀπεσάντιος [Pans. ii. 15. 3]. Καλλίμαχος δὲ ἐν τοῖς Ἰάμβοις τὸ ἐθνικὸν Ἀπέσας φησί· κοὐχ κτλ.",
    "chunk_index": 30,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg007.12.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg007.12.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "αἰτοῦμεν εὐμάθειαν Ἑρμᾶνος δόσιν.",
    "chunk_index": 31,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg007.12.1.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg007.12.1.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Et. Florent. s.v. ὦ τάν.",
    "chunk_index": 32,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg007.13.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg007.13.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "τὰς Ἀφροδίτας (ἡ θεὸς γὰρ οὐ μία) πάσας ὑπερβέβληκε τῷ καλῶς φρονεῖν ἡ Καστνιῆτις· ἥδε γὰρ χαίρει μόνη θυσίαις ὑείαις.",
    "chunk_index": 33,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg007.13.1.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg007.13.1.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Strabo ix. 438 Καλλίμαχος μὲν οὖν φησιν ἐν τοῖς Ἰάμβοις τὰς Ἀφροδίτας (ἡ θεὸς γὰρ οὐ μία) τὴν Καστνιῆτιν ὑπερβάλλεσθαι πάσας τῷ φρονεῖν ὅτι μόνη παραδέχεται τὴν τῶν ὑῶν θυσίαν. We give the above restoration as one more among many: to recover the words of Callimachus with certainty is of course impossible.",
    "chunk_index": 34,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg007.14.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg007.14.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Μοῦσαι καλαὶ κἄπολλον οἷς ἐγὼ σπένδω.",
    "chunk_index": 35,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg007.14.1.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg007.14.1.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Eustath. on Il. ix. 658 and Od. xv. 162, schol. Soph. O.C. 1621, and Suidas.",
    "chunk_index": 36,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg007.15.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg007.15.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "οὐ πρῷν μὲν ἡμῖν ὁ τραγῳδὸς ἤγειρεν.",
    "chunk_index": 37,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg007.15.1.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg007.15.1.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Suid. s.v. πρῴ. Cf. Herodian i. 494. 7 Lentz.",
    "chunk_index": 38,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg007.16.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg007.16.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ἥ τις τραγῳδὸς μοῦσα ληκυθίζουσα.",
    "chunk_index": 39,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg007.16.1.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg007.16.1.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Schol. Saib. Hephaest. p. 36 Gaisf. ii.",
    "chunk_index": 40,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg007.17.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg007.17.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "τὰ νῦν δὲ πολλὴν τυφεδῶνα λεσχαίνεις.",
    "chunk_index": 41,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg007.17.1.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg007.17.1.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Herodian, Περὶ λέξ. μον. ii. p. 914 Lentz.",
    "chunk_index": 42,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg007.18.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg007.18.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "λίχνος εἰμὶ καὶ τὸ πεύθεσθαι.",
    "chunk_index": 43,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg007.18.1.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg007.18.1.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Schol. V Hom. Il. xiv. 172.",
    "chunk_index": 44,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg007.19.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg007.19.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ἔβηξαν οἷον ἀλίβαντα πίνοντες.",
    "chunk_index": 45,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1#tlg0533.tlg007.19.1.1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg0533/tlg007/1st1K-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0533.tlg007.19.1.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "E.M. s.v. ἀλίβας· ὁ νεκρός. . . . σημαίνει δὲ καὶ ὄξος ὡς παρὰ Καλλιμάχῳ· ἔβηξαν κτλ.",
    "chunk_index": 46,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
